  <rdf:Description rdf:nodeID="commodity_lock_2_cb0">
    <crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>the lowest class of remnants after the removal of the fleece, consisting of the shortest wool, coming from the legs and belly of the sheep, lana fracta (OED s.v. lock, n.1 2)</crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>
